//　質問の使者を送っても、梨の礫……」
"I haven't the faintest idea. All of my messengers have been turned away."

//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/mc02/0300030a09'>
//「我らが出向かねば、埒が明かぬやも」
