"I believe that we should direct our remaining forces to prepare for battle at once."

pt:
//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/mc02/0300230a09'>
//「雷蝶殿。
//　我らの手元に残っている兵に、戦闘配置を
